    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p>By using the House Designer website at buildmy.house you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>

    <h2>The site</h2>
    <p>The site describes House Designer, a browser-based home design tool that is still in active development. Content and features may change without notice.</p>

    <h2>Use of the site</h2>
    <p>You may browse and share the site for personal or business use. Do not misuse it: no attempts to disrupt it, gain unauthorized access, or scrape it in a way that harms its availability.</p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>The site's text, design and images belong to House Designer or its licensors. Please do not republish them without permission.</p>

    <h2>Designs are plans, not professional advice</h2>
    <p>Layouts and renders made with House Designer are for planning and visualization. They are not architectural, engineering or building-code advice; check with qualified professionals before building.</p>

    <h2>No warranty and liability</h2>
    <p>The site is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. To the extent permitted by law, House Designer is not liable for losses arising from use of the site.</p>

